docs {
  Requests (specs/033-parser-requests/contracts/requests-api.md). Every request needs the
  `vaultfolio_session` cookie from `auth/Login`. Submitting needs the entitlement of the request
  type's feature; list/detail/update/download are administrator-only. Bodies use invented values
  only — never paste real payslip data here.
}
